实机取证（2026-10-07，boot_b cdsp-vk47clean + Snapshot 50.0）：
- stock vendor DT 的 sensor-position-roll = 后 90 / 前 270，与主线 DT 原值一致；
  但 libcamera simple-pipeline + Snapshot 预览/录像前后摄都翻转 180°。
- 数学特征：若 app 对 Orientation 应用方向相反，R=90 与 R=270 均产生 180° 误差。
  故 DT 取 stock roll 的补角（270/90），实机确认前后成像均正。
- DTB 差异仅此两行（old vs new decompile diff），内核/ramdisk sha 不变。
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-lenovo-elden.dts | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-lenovo-elden.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-lenovo-elden.dts
index b099f9e12..776dfd77b 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-lenovo-elden.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-lenovo-elden.dts
@@ -2290,7 +2290,7 @@ rear_camera: camera@56 {
 		lens-focus = <&rear_lens>;
 		flash-leds = <&rear_flash>;
 		orientation = <1>;
-		rotation = <90>;
+		rotation = <270>;
 
 		port {
 			rear_camera_out: endpoint {
@@ -2326,7 +2326,7 @@ front_camera: camera@31 {
 		dvdd-supply = <&camera_ldo2>;
 		avdd-supply = <&camera_ldo3>;
 		orientation = <0>;
-		rotation = <270>;
+		rotation = <90>;
 
 		port {
 			front_camera_out: endpoint {
